<div class="pp-content-grid-post-text">
    
        <div class="pp-content-grid-post-meta">
		<a href="https://www.indexindustry.org/category/news/in-the-news/" rel="tag" class="in-the-news">In the News</a>
		<span class="pp-content-grid-post-meta-sep"> | </span>
		October 2, 2026
    </div>


    <h3 class="pp-content-grid-post-title"><a href='https://www.indexindustry.org/index-industry-association-welcomes-tilt-indices-as-newest-member-2/' title='Index Industry Association welcomes Tilt Indices as newest member'>Index Industry Association welcomes Tilt Indices as newest member</a></h3>


    <div class="pp-content-grid-post-excerpt">
    	<p>ETF Express</p>

    </div>


</div>

